">雪完全覆盖了整个城镇。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">間違い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まちがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">错误；错处；失误；事故；意外；麻烦；（男女间的）不当行为；失检；越轨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219654\">この<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いだらけだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书充满了错误</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">真っ赤</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まっか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">鲜红；深红；(脸)潮红；彻头彻尾的；完全的；十足的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">全く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まったく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完全；彻底；真正；确实；的确；实在；天哪；真是的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"86260\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她对烹饪很无知</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">松</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><spa