p><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できるんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这只鸟可以模仿人类的声音</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">招く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まねく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邀请；招待；招手；挥手示意；做手势；召来；传唤；召集；招致；引起；造成；导致；惹来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166507\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはジェーンとエレンを<ruby>招<rp>(</rp><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くつもりだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们要邀请简和艾伦</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ママ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妈妈；妈咪；母亲；女老板（酒吧等的）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137835\"><ruby>台所<rp>(</rp><rt>だいどころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でママのお<ruby>手伝<rp>(</rp><rt>てつだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いをしたの。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在厨房帮了妈妈</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">豆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">豆类（尤指可食用豆类或其种子，如豆子、豌豆等）；豆；豌豆；大豆；黄豆；女性生殖器官（尤指阴蒂）；（烹饪）腰子；小；微型；迷你；小规模；儿童；小孩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202874\">チョコレートはココアの<ruby>豆<rp>(</rp><rt>まめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">巧克力是用可可豆做的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/10368461\" title=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">守る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まもる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保护；守卫；防守；遵守；履行；遵循；服从；遵从</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228865\">いったん<ruby>約束<rp>(</rp><rt>やくそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したのであれば、<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一旦你做了承诺, 你必须遵守它。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:迷う\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">迷う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">犹豫；迷路</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">どちらを<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うか<ruby>迷<rp>(</rp><rt>まよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正在犹豫买哪个。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">圆；圆形；整体；全部；完整；钱；金钱；城郭内的围郭区域；鳖；甲鱼；（用于船名、人名（尤指婴儿）、刀剑·铠甲·乐器等名称、犬马等名称的）后缀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126860\"><ruby>地図<rp>(</rp><rt>ちず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>丸<rp>(</rp><rt>まる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>示<rp>(</rp><rt>しめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">红圈在地图标记学校。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">まるで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰如；就像；好像；仿佛；宛如；毫；丝毫；一点儿（多用于否定句）；完全；彻底；十分；真正</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158843\">まるで<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ているようだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我觉得好像在做梦</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まわす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">转；旋转；使旋转；扭转；传递；递送；传阅；流通；调配；派送；转送；转交；转发；提交；改作他用；挪作他用；启动；开动；转动（洗衣机等）；发动（引擎）；使（某人）处于（某立场）；使成为（如敌人）；（接在动词后）到处…；遍…；…个遍；以…围住；以…围绕；搂（腰等）；将（手臂）环绕在…；投资；放贷；拨（电话号码）；轮奸；经营；运营；管理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"7957077\">トムさん，モーターを<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>まわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请启动马达,汤姆。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旋转；转动；巡回；走一圈；蔓延；传播；效果；功效；经由；通过；圈；轮；尺寸；大小；十二年；相差十二岁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165536\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>まわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りに<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们把老师围在了一起</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">万一</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まんいち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">万一；万分之一的可能；最坏的情况；万一；如果万一；万一要是；倘若</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81180\"><ruby>万一<rp>(</rp><rt>まんいち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>場合<rp>(</rp><rt>ばあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>備<rp>(</rp><rt>そな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>貯金<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのは<ruby>賢明<rp>(</rp><rt>けんめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为雨季省钱是明智之举。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">満足</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まんぞく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">满足；满意；满意感；充分；充足；恰当；得当；满足（方程式）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101854\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>努<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めて<ruby>雇<rp>(</rp><rt>やと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>主<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>満足<rp>(</rp><rt>まんぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させようとした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他热衷于满足他的雇主。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">マーケット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">市场</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195823\">マーケットが<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたとたんに<ruby>火事<rp>(</rp><rt>かじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がおきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火灾爆发时市场很少开放。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">み</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">果实；果子；坚果；种子；籽；汤料；配料；内容；实质；本质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80094\"><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>果実<rp>(</rp><rt>かじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のみの<ruby>重<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さでたわんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那棵树在他们的水果重量之下弯曲下来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">身</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">み</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">身体；身躯；自己；外表；仪表；身份；地位；主体部分；肉（相对于骨、皮等）；木质（相对于树皮）；刀身（相对于刀柄）；器身（相对于盖子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147954\"><ruby>重労働<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうろうどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>身<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にこたえはじめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">辛勤工作开始告诉了他</span></div></li>"]